Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Technology, materials and components used for heating systems in apartment buildings
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data from call of bids for a heating system of a specific building used. Data completed with information from literature and from manufacturers 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ebde33db-24ae-3dd7-b27b-74c3f15b97cc.xml</text>
